# The voice modal's phase line (status + what a tap does), and the two
# failures the controller surfaces in its own notice area.
voice-phase-listening = 正在聆听——点击发送
voice-phase-speaking = 正在说话——点击打断
voice-recording-stop-failed = 无法停止录音：{ $error }
voice-network-error = 网络错误：{ $error }

# Why the microphone would not start. Shown at the moment someone is
# trying to talk to the gateway, so they need it in their own language.
voice-mic-insecure-context = 语音录制需要 HTTPS 或 localhost —— 在普通 http 下已禁用。
voice-mic-no-worklet = 语音录制需要 AudioWorklet 支持。
voice-mic-denied = 麦克风访问被拒绝。请在浏览器中允许后重试。
voice-mic-not-found = 未找到麦克风。
voice-mic-busy = 麦克风正被占用 —— 可能有其他应用在使用它。
voice-mic-error = 麦克风错误：{ $error }
